full-query: "A healthcare organization is using Cloud Spanner to store sensitive patient data. The organization needs to ensure high availability and disaster recovery while maintaining low-latency read and write operations, and adhering to strict data residency requirements. The company operates in a country where the Google Cloud region is located. Which of the following options should the organization choose to best meet their requirements?"
